SUMMARY:Comedy at Lincoln's Cottage
LOCATION:Washington
DESCRIPTION:These events are at President Lincoln's Cottage\, which sells a
 ll the tickets and sets venue policies.\n\nEnjoy a comedy show at one of DC
 's coolest historic homes! Since 2016\, President Lincoln's Cottage and the
  DC Improv have collaborated on The Two Faces comedy series\, bringing live
  entertainment to Abraham Lincoln's favorite retreat. Each year the series 
 features three comedy shows\, each with a theme that ties back to either th
 e Lincolns or the way they used the cottage.\n\nThis year's series features
  the following shows:\n\nSeptember 24: Immigration. Comics from immigrant f
 amilies.\n\nOctober 7: Political Brawling. The Washington Roast presents a 
 special edition with historical presidents insulting each other.\n\nNovembe
 r 4: Veterans. A lineup of comics who have served in the military.\n\nDecem
 ber 15: Incarceration. Inspired by the Cottage's new "Prison Reimagined" ex
 hibit.\n\nPresident Lincoln’s Cottage is an historic site and museum loca
 ted in the Petworth neighborhood in Northwest Washington\, D.C. President L
 incoln’s Cottage first opened to the public in February 2008. It is the o
 nly place the public can experience the history of Abraham Lincoln’s publ
 ic and private life where he lived and worked for over a quarter of his pre
 sidency. While in residence at the Cottage\, Lincoln visited with wounded s
 oldiers\, spent time with self-emancipated men\, women and children\, and d
 eveloped the Emancipation Proclamation. The human cost of the Civil War sur
 rounded him\, undoubtedly impacted his thinking\, and strengthened his reso
 lve to challenge the status quo. Through innovative guided tours\, exhibits
  and programs\, we use Lincoln’s example to inspire visitors to take thei
 r own path to greatness\, and preserve this place as an authentic\, tangibl
 e connection to the past and a beacon of hope for all who take up Lincoln
 ’s unfinished work.\nMore info: https://comedyatlas.app/comedy-atlas/even
 t/comedy-at-lincoln-s-cottage/
URL:https://comedyatlas.app/comedy-atlas/event/comedy-at-lincoln-s-cottage/
